                    <div class="story-content">
                        <div class="section-header text-start">
                            <span class="section-subtitle">About Us</span>
                            <h2 class="section-title">Crafting Excellence Since 2003</h2>
                        </div>
                        <p class="lead">Founded with a vision to redefine the boundaries between architecture and
                            interior design, Luxe Studio has grown into an award-winning firm known for exceptional
                            craftsmanship and innovative design solutions.</p>
                        <p>Our journey began when our founder, Sarah Mitchell, recognized the need for a holistic
                            approach to design—one that seamlessly integrates architectural form with interior function.
                            What started as a small studio with big dreams has evolved into a multidisciplinary team of
                            passionate architects, designers, and craftsmen.</p>
                        <p>Today, we continue to push the boundaries of design, creating spaces that not only meet our
                            clients' practical needs but also inspire and elevate their daily lives. Our collaborative
                            approach ensures that each project is a true reflection of our clients' vision, lifestyle,
                            and aspirations.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

